OL,3,ARussia strikes second major bridge in
OL,4,AKyiv, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two bridges link the eastern and
OL,7,Fwestern parts of the capital and had
OL,8,Fnot been hit before Thursday,
OL,9,Fsignalling a new stage in Moscow's
OL,10,Fattacks.
